          guideText: `{name}, Africa is the world's second largest continent with 54 countries, over 2000 languages, and some of the oldest civilizations on Earth. It is also the continent most systematically reduced to a single story — poverty, conflict, aid. This lesson pushes back against that reduction by examining what Africa actually is before we look at specific cases.`,
